m1	615,2088,1235,2230		The chain of chords of the mode of the minor Third, f - a¹♭ + C - E¹♭ + G - b¹♭ + d; round braces above join the minor chords f-a¹♭-C, C-E¹♭-G, G-b¹♭-d, square braces below the major chords a¹♭-C-E¹♭ and E¹♭-G-b¹♭.
m2	615,2305,1235,2445		The chain furnished by our minor mode with b₁, f - a¹♭ + C - E¹♭ + G + b₁ - d; round braces above join the minor chords f-a¹♭-C and C-E¹♭-G, square braces below the major chords a¹♭-C-E¹♭ and G-b₁-d: one triad less.
